<word key="gdcompliance_acp_rules_intro" js="0"><![CDATA[Edit the state magazine-capacity rules used to flag products. Disabling a rule (or letting expires_date pass) stops it from flagging without deleting the row. A rule applies only when enabled AND inside its effective_date/expires_date window. Capacity strictly greater than max_capacity flags the product.]]></word>
