<word key="gdcompliance_acp_review_intro" js="0"><![CDATA[Handguns the matcher could not confidently place on or off the roster. Each row shows the near-miss roster candidates the matcher considered. Resolve each manually — "Mark on-roster" clears the CA restriction for that UPC, "Mark off-roster" sets the CA flag. Decisions persist across re-computes (only unresolved rows are wiped + re-populated on each compute).]]></word>
